  "notes": [
    "Regular -IR verb — follows standard -IR endings with no exceptions",
    "Past participle: *unido* (regular)",
    "Means \"to unite,\" \"to join,\" or \"to combine\" — *unir fuerzas* (to join forces), *unir los dos cables* (to join the two wires)",
    "Reflexive form *unirse* means \"to join\" (a group/activity): *me uní al equipo* (I joined the team)",
    "Related: *unión* (union), *unido/a* (united, close-knit — *una familia unida*)"
  ],
